      "html": "<table class=\"ds-ledger\"><tr><th>Turn</th><th>R1</th><th class=\"ds-now\">R2</th></tr><tr><th>Bola</th><td><span class=\"ds-mark\">PAID OUT</span></td><td class=\"ds-now\"><span class=\"ds-empty-sm\"></span></td></tr></table>",
